# OVL-8: switching profile ends a held layer (docs/development/layers.md). Base: LB holds
# Hotkeys (A is F1 then). Second maps A to Z. Letting go of LB afterwards changes nothing, and
# going back to Base does not bring the layer back.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/layers-across.padpack Base
press lb
tap south 30
cli profile Second
tap south 30
release lb
tap south 30
cli profile Base
tap south 30
---
shifts mode - layers Hotkeys                     @0
key KEY_F1 down                                  @0
key KEY_F1 up                                    @30
profile Scenario layers across profiles › Second @30
overlay none + info 1                            @30
key KEY_Z down                                   @30
key KEY_Z up                                     @60
key KEY_Z down                                   @60
key KEY_Z up                                     @90
profile Scenario layers across profiles › Base   @90
key KEY_A down                                   @90
key KEY_A up                                     @120
